   {
    "text": "Hey there, foodies! 🍴✨\n\nWelcome to **Buena Onda**, the place where *Argentinian* flavors meet your taste buds in the most delicious way possible! Whether you're a fan of beef, tango, or just plain good food, this place is the ultimate destination for the *Argentinian* foodie who wants to feel like they're in the heart of the pampas.\n\n*highlighted section*  \nAt Buena Onda, we serve up *Argentinian* cuisine that's as vibrant as the Rio de la Plata and as bold as a good Argentinian wine. From *asado* (grilled meat) to *churrasco* (grilled skewers), every bite is a celebration of flavor and tradition. You won’t find a better place to savor the *Argentinian* spirit than in our cozy, lively atmosphere.\n\n*highlighted section*  \nWe’ve got a *Argentinian* menu that’s as diverse as the country itself. Think *arroz con gandules* (rice with pigeon), *lentil soup*, and *tacos de cebolla* (onion tacos) — all made with the same passion and care that goes into the best *Argentinian* dishes. And don’t forget the *parrilla* — the grill that’s been passed down through generations.\n\n*highlighted section*  \nBut what makes Buena Onda special isn’t just the food — it’s the vibe. We’re all about *Argentinian* energy, from the music to the service to the *argentinian* attitude. Whether you're here for a casual meal or a *tango* night, you’ll leave feeling like you’ve been transported to the heart of the pampas.\n\nSo, if you're looking for a place to *argentinian* your taste buds, head to Buena Onda — where every bite is a *tango* in the kitchen. 🥂🔥\n\n#BuenaOnda #ArgentinianFood #TacoLove #FoodieFiesta",
